    "catalog:tags": "bicycle, cycle, cycle parking, vehicle",
    "catalog:note": "Bicycle, front to +z, wheels as solid discs on the floor. The frame is drawn with upright and level tubes, since tilted parts are unverified. The plan is the two wheels, the frame line, the saddle and the handlebar. Parts under radius 0.04 build as polygonal prisms at true size.",
    "catalog:basedOn": "Bicycle 0.60 x 1.80 x 1.05, generic practice size, not checked against a published source (unverified). No vehicle class in IFC4 ADD2 TC1 (buildingSMART Standards-builds), so IfcBuildingElementProxy USERDEFINED",
